            "description": {
              "content": "Returns real-time report data (paginated).\nGood for small reports (<10K rows) from report having tag - marketplace:{marketplace_type}:{object_type}:{operation}:report. Usable for bigger reports too with the risk of missing or ghost rows due to concurrent updates going in the same time.",
